  message: "Added isbefore links to Wave 6 cross-language items per plan analysis: INV-judod (shares js_ts.py), WI-pulor (shares bash.py), WI-zolot (downstream consumer of TS module pseudo-node shape), INV-tajap (cross-language entrypoint detection consumes file-canonical shape). Wiring this ordering into the tracker so 'tracker ready' enforces INV-kokaj-first sequencing — otherwise those items would write the kind='module' anti-pattern that INV-kokaj then has to migrate. Plan source: ~/.claude/plans/valiant-juggling-hamming.md (plan was written before INV-kokaj was filed)."  # 524c
