  message: "Shipped via PRs ce80aaf2 (production fix) + 398f2e19 (schema-coverage baseline refresh). All 5 cross-language analyzers (JS/TS, Bash, Perl, PHP, PowerShell) now emit the file pseudo-node via make_file_id(lang, path) with kind='file' and name=<repo-relative path>. Perl package_statement Symbols keep kind='module' (real namespacing, not per-file anchors). Bakeoff validation tag added because the elimination of analyzer-emitted kind='module' file-anchor Symbols across 5 languages is the cross-language analog of INV-hojus's 332-paths-with-both-kinds reduction — bakeoff-broad cycle should pick this up via structural-graph coverage signals."  # 840d
