  message: "Stripping tag under Phase 2 anomaly cleanup. Verdict: D-stale via property test (same call as sibling INV-hojus). The claim 'no cross-language analyzer emits kind=module file-anchor Symbols' is a B-shape property. The property test TestInvKokajFileCanonicalKind in test_inv_kokaj_cross_lang_file_canonical.py pins the invariant for all 5 covered languages structurally on every analyzer run. The closing entry's 'bakeoff-broad cycle should pick this up via structural-graph coverage signals' is a side hope, not the primary claim. Property-test enforcement strictly dominates a one-shot cohort measurement for shape claims."  # 4cbb
